  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alignment meeting HortiNord</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to keep momentum, Netherlands embassy in Abidjan, C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire would like to facilitate an alignment meeting with all local and Dutch stakeholders in C&#xf4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire, Yamoussoukro, to go through each element of the programme, discuss financials, build integration between different project partners, to come up with a solid plan and foundation for the future.All companies and project partners are invited to join a three-day alignment session at the plantation in Toumbokro. The session will be hosted by a skilled facilitator.Alignment will be needed for the conventional cluster, the agroecological cluster, the incubation pillar, and all three interlinked.</narrative>
  </description>
